{"time": 1752995536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1697223364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "使用祝福术，光芒笼罩了自己在内的五人，“神啊，请你为众人献上赐福。”"}
