{"time": 1753091520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "117548835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（然后可以给亚里沙）"}
{"time": 1753091540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "952981359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（以防她被贴脸只能吃ao射箭（）"}
{"time": 1753091718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2008279438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好像也对)"}
{"time": 1753091755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "461869583", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好像没什么了。\"把珍珠递给枷薇，\"这个对枷薇了，你的法术比我的有用。\""}
{"time": 1753091761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "969453023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好像没什么了。\"把珍珠递给枷薇，\"这个给枷薇了，你的法术比我的有用。\""}
{"time": 1753091798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1618061708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢奥契丝姐姐，我会珍藏的...”小心翼翼的收起来"}
{"time": 1753091815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "737023249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（这个珍珠以后不能卖了（bushi）"}
{"time": 1753091825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1285499194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没啥啦，枷薇值得更好的，这个暂时用用就行了。\""}
{"time": 1753091841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "267412624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"亚里莎，把尸体带上，走啦。\""}
{"time": 1753092008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1507886079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好”"}
{"time": 1753092033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "4419739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（下来去哪，我已经给地图标号了（）"}
{"time": 1753092039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "515428973", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "带着尸体回去见之前遇见的那些人"}
{"time": 1753092073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1235413344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"该找个合适的地方停留一下\""}
{"time": 1753092093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095130743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"正好也打听清楚这边的事情\""}
{"time": 1753092146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1820815940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "约克看到你们背着变形怪的尸体回来，有点惊喜“两位的胆识和能力真是过人，我这就带你们去见我们这里的首领”"}
{"time": 1753092240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1653774552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦?你还不是这里的领军人物吗？\"打量他一眼，\"行吧，不过在那之前，能说明这边发生了什么吗？\""}
{"time": 1753092300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1857586419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“具体的你问我们首领吧”"}
{"time": 1753092330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1611249855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你们跟着约克来到了一个小教堂"}
{"time": 1753092335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "393309941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一些临时搭建的草席摆放在小教堂的神祗的雕像之下，在碎裂的玻璃下映射着火光。蓝色与紫罗兰色组成的彩色玻璃窗在疗养院的兰栅之间形成了螺旋图样，许多烛光静静地在壁龛中摇曳。"}
{"time": 1753092354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "350003289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\""}
{"time": 1753092385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688084954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "小教堂主要供奉的是法萊斯瑪，教堂的西侧耸立着祂的雕像而且在螺旋的彩色玻璃窗上也有着祂的圣徽。然而也有一些只点燃着蜡烛的小神龛供奉着阿巴達爾，黛絲娜，埃拉斯蒂爾，哥茲萊，艾奧梅黛，義洛理，莎倫萊和紗琳，甚至在阿斯摩蒂斯和宗－庫山的圣徽下也有一个小小的贡纳箱。一些较少见的神祗也在这里都会摆放着一个圣徽和一些蜡烛。因此地乃是让每一个悲痛的人都可以为自己所爱之人祈求指引或怜悯之地。"}
{"time": 1753092412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "768410103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这么多神祇供奉?\"皱皱眉小声"}
{"time": 1753092552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "85660149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看向正面站着谁"}
{"time": 1753092560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1305376927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "约克带你们到了一个看起来是领导者的女子面前“温特女士，这两位小姐是新来的幸存者，她们杀了好几只变形怪，应该不是那些家伙”"}
{"time": 1753092591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1862440367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“两位怎么称呼“被换做温特的女士向你们询问"}
{"time": 1753092613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1799804010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（然后约克便离开了）"}
{"time": 1753092661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1990518417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"奥契丝。\"牵起裙摆礼貌地鞠一躬"}
{"time": 1753092717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1939237449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我叫伽薇”伽薇感觉有点怕生，两只手抓着你的胳膊半躲在你的身后"}
{"time": 1753092782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1084743566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"枷薇有些怕生，您见谅。\""}
{"time": 1753092811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1888773845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没关系，没关系，听说你们杀掉了北方洗衣房那只怪物，可以看出二位实力超群啊”温特笑呵呵的说到，不过表情看起来比较官方，有种很客套的感觉"}
{"time": 1753092888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1308101288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"实力...不清楚，可能只是运气比较好。\"同样露出一个官方的客套微笑"}
{"time": 1753092909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "100732973", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"温特女士应该是有事找我们?正好我们也有事要问问。\""}
{"time": 1753093073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1319752105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，如你所见，我们这里好多人都需要帮助，如果你能够稍微帮助他们的话，我会知无不言的”"}
{"time": 1753093150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "685132650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（通马桶小任务（））"}
{"time": 1753093190, "type": "recv", "message_id": "262298360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"您的意思是?我要给这里的人排忧解难?\"皱起眉"}
{"time": 1753093206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1737561514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我有一定要这么做的理由吗？\""}
{"time": 1753093207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "578661516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃个饭）"}
{"time": 1753094626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "134504516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（因为你是守序善良（bushi）"}
{"time": 1753094716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2115736029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(睡醒之后就不是了喵)"}
{"time": 1753094744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1099135551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“奥契丝小姐不要生气，我并不是让你白白帮忙，如你所见这里都是一些可怜人，病的病伤的伤，而且因为一些原因，这所疗养院如同被封锁了一般，也出不去，资源也有点紧缺，如果你愿意帮忙的话，我们会把你当做自己人的”"}
{"time": 1753094773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1779000841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "四周好多人都穿着病号服，还有一些人受着严重的伤，看起来像个难民营一样"}
{"time": 1753094819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "236842785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2115736029]（先天混沌恶，后天守序善？）[CQ:at,qq=1252219916]"}
{"time": 1753094832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1126452531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(善良的人是活不下去的)"}
{"time": 1753094863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "310131853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1099135551]\"这里到底发生了什么?\""}
{"time": 1753094898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1561335924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也不是特别清楚...但要是奥契丝小姐愿意加入我们的话，我会把知道的事情都告诉你的”"}
{"time": 1753094920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2121689005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\""}
{"time": 1753095016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "556899775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你不先说明一些的话，我很难说什么有建设性的话。\"眯着眼睛"}
{"time": 1753095019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "793859079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那你是什么阵营）"}
{"time": 1753095089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1300197996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“奥契丝小姐之前有做过噩梦吧，这座疗养院似乎被诅咒了，一睡着就会做噩梦，所幸这里有女神保佑，在这里休息的话虽然也会做梦，但不会有其他影响”"}
{"time": 1753095104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "819060558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我都不记得我是谁，怎么会知道自己是什么阵营)"}
{"time": 1753095120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1066875794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（肯定看你的卡啊）"}
{"time": 1753095137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1028316950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(cg吧也许)"}
{"time": 1753095139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "530023677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你填了就代表你醒来之后是什么阵营（）"}
{"time": 1753095143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "790507334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1753095573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1763994341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1300197996]\"嗯...然后呢？\""}
{"time": 1753095622, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1639097076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“总之奥契丝小姐愿意向他们展示你的善意的话，我也愿意向你展示我的善意”"}
{"time": 1753095647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1189178045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"确实是在这里做过奇怪的梦。\"皱着眉，\"好吧，你想让我提供什么？\""}
{"time": 1753095973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1923295967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"只是帮助这里的人的话，也可以接受。\""}
{"time": 1753096003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "655877160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“做什么都可以啊，比如艾尔温和贝茨在之前的地震中受了伤，如果小姐你会治疗的话，可以去帮一下她们；鲁瓦克经常出现幻觉，耐撒护士在照顾着他，所幸相关的药现在并不缺少，但是鲁瓦克经常拒绝吃药，也许你可以劝鲁瓦克按时吃药；或者你也可以去教堂那边拆拆破损的家具来获取柴火，如果小姐厨艺精通的话，做饭也是可以的”"}
{"time": 1753096041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1513146202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1923295967][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “那多谢小姐了，晚饭时间见”"}
{"time": 1753096214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1351265483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真是....扔给我一个麻烦的烂摊子。\""}
{"time": 1753096232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "669405013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"所以，你还是没跟我说明，这里发生了什么?以及，要怎么解决。\""}
{"time": 1753096299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "593892350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“抱歉，不能多聊了，我也还有事情要处理，晚饭时候再聊吧”"}
{"time": 1753096327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "47539848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（哎，要不把任务跳过吧）"}
{"time": 1753096331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1921864741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（直接快进到晚饭）"}
{"time": 1753096375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1949540480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这些b任务)"}
{"time": 1753096383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1097213899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我不是很容易做吗？)"}
{"time": 1753096395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1106133296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(如果要提高rp含量的话，你可以不跳)"}
{"time": 1753096403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2000025643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不想rp的话，可以跳)"}
{"time": 1753096522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "196763616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那就跳吧）"}
{"time": 1753096547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1079940672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（毕竟只是一些支线小任务"}
{"time": 1753096624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "824457707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(ok)"}
{"time": 1753096883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1735962555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那你和枷薇对温特的离去感觉有些无语，但还是想办法去完成了她说的那些任务，你能感觉到周围的人看向你的目光由一开始的警惕变成了和善，大家都很喜欢你们。"}
{"time": 1753096980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1081089161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "有些摸不清这里的逻辑，姑且按照她的吩咐把这些鸡毛蒜皮的事情处理完，小声，\"枷薇...在这里也要小心谨慎才行。\""}
{"time": 1753097007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1419863652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，我会注意的，奥契丝姐姐”"}
{"time": 1753097042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1522671173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "傍晚，在一个小角落的火堆旁，温特递给了你们用从已经坍塌了的储藏室里找到的干鹿肉做成的洋葱肉汤，非常和善的笑容“尝尝味道吧，辛苦你们了”"}
{"time": 1753097099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1286112917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "背过身，使用侦测毒素稍微看一眼"}
{"time": 1753097106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1874658822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "没有毒"}
{"time": 1753097140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "629685013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "放心地喝一口，\"味道很好，不客气。我们也是忠君之事\""}
{"time": 1753097206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "229649703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以小姐，我很乐意分享一些我知道的事情，你有什么想问的事情就问吧”"}
{"time": 1753097333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1661976246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "沉默了一会，\"这里是哪里?\""}
{"time": 1753097349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2052777813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“棘石疗养院。一家建立在丹沃河中的一座小岛上的疗养院—一个可以用来安置麻烦的人的便利的地方。”"}
{"time": 1753097384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1669902239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可以过个知识本地 或者知识地理）"}
{"time": 1753097521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1225969106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd+7"}
{"time": 1753097521, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1225969106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[桃乐丝]演奏出: 1D20+7={18}+7=25"}
{"time": 1753097533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1230571843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯..\""}
{"time": 1753097643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1777411513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "棘石疗养院位于烏斯塔拉夫的維塞克斯"}
{"time": 1753097668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1666184953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（什么b地名）"}
{"time": 1753097695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "645759761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（总之是格拉利昂的一个地名）"}
{"time": 1753097743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "560197580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“麻烦的人？具体说来听听吧。”"}
{"time": 1753097811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1719948462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“就是这里的病人，大部分都是有精神疾病的，这里的医生致力于治疗和研究关于精神疾病。棘石疗养院虽不是什么大名鼎鼎的诊所，但并不是民众口中折磨人的那种”"}
{"time": 1753097818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1701127975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（就是精神病院（））"}
{"time": 1753097880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "615684386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"原来如此，那...为什么会变成现在这个样子?\"沉思"}
{"time": 1753097955, "type": "recv", "message_id": "555432812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我不清楚具体情况，好像是发生了一起暴动，是一名患者带头的。不过这与其说是暴动更像是一场宗教运动。现在北边的建筑几乎都被那些穿着长袍自称黄衣使徒的病人们占据着。我们曾经遇到过他们，他们似乎狂热地崇拜这一个名叫乌尔维尔·赞达鲁斯的病人。”"}
{"time": 1753098004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1760593848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"梦中的黄色烟雾也是他们搞的鬼?\""}
{"time": 1753098006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "678857026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“在那起暴动之后，又发生了一场地震，如今疗养院就变成了现在的样子”"}
{"time": 1753098083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1171453379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我对噩梦也所知甚少，听一些人说梦里有着和外面一样令人不适的雾气，在穿过之后便看到一座空荡荡的城市或一个被破布缠绕的男人。一些在教堂外歇息的人时而也会尖叫着惊醒。我虽然不知道这一切意味着什么，但在这个小教堂里，女神守望着我们的梦。”"}
{"time": 1753098247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1568739616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"....我知道了。\"叹口气，\"我不知道我为什么会在这里。\""}
{"time": 1753098290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1691221031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我很抱歉无法回答这个问题。你不是第一个在这里丢失自己记忆的人。如果你是一名患者，那么这里一定有关于你的档案。”"}
{"time": 1753098308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "226450660", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"醒来的时候，我就在地下的...也许不是，总之在一处监牢之中。\"紧搂着枷薇，\"嗯...档案在哪里?\""}
{"time": 1753098428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "862407082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "对方拿出了一张地图给你指了一下“在这个位置”（c17）\"不过疗养院自从暴动之后出现了很多怪物，你要去的话一定要小心\""}
{"time": 1753098487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2101931643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(是不是有点太远了)"}
{"time": 1753098528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "941038310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可以先不去）"}
{"time": 1753098568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1974794665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...谢谢，不过我最终还是要去一趟。\"叹口气，\"嗯...你们现在在这里做什么?而且，为什么不出去?\""}
{"time": 1753098626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2107198272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，那我重新自我介绍一下，奥契丝小姐，我叫温特·克拉兹卡，是来自卡利法斯的少女圣咏大教堂的修女，我和我的同伴在帮助皇家御史调查瑟拉什摩爾附近的奇怪事件。”"}
{"time": 1753098744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "263941291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"奇怪事件?\"疑惑地看着她"}
{"time": 1753098833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1583961214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哈斯顿·劳尔斯，維塞克斯伯爵似乎许久不曾打理政务了。而且Accuser Omari有证据表明劳尔斯经常到访棘石岛。她指派我和其他同伴在她前往維塞克斯时调查疗养院。”"}
{"time": 1753098852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "966204371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那个英文前半部分应该是御史，后半部分是名字）"}
{"time": 1753098903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2083811195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"....您继续。\""}
{"time": 1753098913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "754019462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可以过个知识本地，看看这个皇家御史具体是什么东西）"}
{"time": 1753098985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "342042993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd+7"}
{"time": 1753098985, "type": "reply", "message_id": "342042993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[桃乐丝]演奏出: 1D20+7={17}+7=24"}
{"time": 1753099015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "401659845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“至于如今为什么不离开，我们也想离开这里，但是外面的世界似乎充满了恶意。我甚至不知道这里还是不是棘石岛，或是其他空间，但是疗养院整体都被可怕的雾气笼罩着。更可怕的是我从没见过这么诡异的天气—打雷发出的是笑声，而下的雨则像鲜血。而且里面还能看到我们在梦中看到的可怕身形在雾里走动。这里的情况很糟糕，但至少在这里我们还能看清自己的终结。”"}
{"time": 1753099055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1223225093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=841055913]皇家御史是是烏斯塔拉夫王室的秘密特工，他们严格执行法律和准确的正义且不考虑国家各种奇特的头衔和阶级"}
{"time": 1753099137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1804335778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"看来，这里的人被困住了？\"叹口气，\"我甚至不知道我是怎么进来的。嗯...物资方面?\""}
{"time": 1753099159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1066457187", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "轻轻摸了摸枷薇的脑袋安抚"}
{"time": 1753099168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2063172637", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“目前，剩下的物资还够大家存活七天吧”"}
{"time": 1753099231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "491274792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个奥契丝小姐，伽薇小姐，我很抱歉并不能告诉你们具体发生了什么，但我知道我们不能够留在这里。我们需要逃出去。我思虑再三，这里最适合这个任务的似乎只有你们。如果你们能找到一条避开那片可怕的迷雾的逃生之路，我会觐见皇家御史并给与你们回报。我恳求你们帮助我们。”"}
{"time": 1753099288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "521115871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉...这里的人里没有德鲁伊吗？\""}
