{"time": 1753100694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1985232771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "吃完饭，温特带你和伽薇到了两张简陋的床前“目前只有这种条件了，两位见谅”"}
{"time": 1753100775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1460582927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"麻烦了，有这种条件已经不错了。\"点点头，表达一番感谢"}
